WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.304 --> 00:00:14.139
Everything starts with a plan

00:00:15.224 --> 00:00:17.809
A plan is how we know the way

00:00:17.893 --> 00:00:21.104
When we're struggling
And we're not sure we can

00:00:21.188 --> 00:00:23.941
We start with a plan
And by the end of the day

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:27.152
We'll be all high fives and handshakes

00:00:27.236 --> 00:00:30.781
When we see what a difference a plan makes

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:32.658
'Cause everything starts

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:36.245
With a plan

00:00:37.412 --> 00:00:39.498
-We're the Helpsters!
-The Helpsters!

00:00:39.915 --> 00:00:41.083
For problems...

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:42.835
-...big...
-...or small.

00:00:42.918 --> 00:00:45.462
We're here to help solve them all.

